        "subject": "LU-0000 quota: ignore edquot if in-fligh request exists",
        "message": "LU-0000 quota: ignore edquot if in-fligh request exists\n\nlocal quota information (including cached edquot) should be ignored\nas long as there is in-flight request to acquire quota.\nthis is to solve a race when just send quota acquisition request\ncauses local lqe_edquot status update via ldlm glimpse.\n\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly testlist=sanity-quota\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly testlist=sanity-quota\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly testlist=sanity-quota\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota\nTest-Parameters: fortestonly fstype=zfs testlist=sanity-quota\nSigned-off-by: Alex Zhuravlev <bzzz@whamcloud.com>\nChange-Id: I032c18bcc476534a2b229bec0af421b2c35ff062\n"
      },
